  !>   @param[in] csrSortedColIndA - array of \p nnz elements containing the column indices of the
  !>   sparse
  !>                    CSR matrix \f$A\f$.
  !>   @param[in] B - array of \p m \f$\times\f$ \p nrhs elements of the rhs matrix \f$B\f$.
